# Expo demo. `expo-env.d.ts` is deliberately NOT ignored (unlike the Expo template) so
# that `bun run qts:expo` is hermetic; it is excluded from Biome instead.
# Unqualified: Expo resolves its workspace root to the monorepo root, so `.expo`
# is created here as well as under demo/expo.
.expo
